# EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

EduGenie is an AI-powered educational assistant designed to help students learn concepts, ask questions, generate quizzes, summarize content, and create personalized learning paths.

The application uses a FastAPI backend, HTML/CSS frontend, Google Gemini API, and an optional local LaMini-Flan-T5 model for concept explanations.

---

## Features

EduGenie provides the following features:

- Ask educational questions
- Explain difficult concepts in simple language
- Generate multiple-choice quizzes
- Summarize long text
- Generate personalized learning paths
- Responsive web interface
- Google Gemini API integration
- Optional local AI model for explanations
- FastAPI REST API
- Interactive quiz interface
- API documentation using Swagger UI

